 "stories": {
  "jai-herbert-matheus-camilo": {
   "summary": "Herbert's jab and right hand had the early edge until Camilo wobbled him with an overhand and took him down late in round 1. Camilo took him down again in round 2 and reached mount and the back, but lost top position with two minutes left and Herbert won the round with ground-and-pound. A tiring Camilo was out-jabbed and stuffed on his shots in round 3: 29-28 on every card.",
   "turning_point": "Round 2: Camilo lost mount; Herbert's top position from there swung the round and the fight.",
