  "brendan-allen-christian-leroy-duncan": {
   "summary": "Duncan was the sharper striker for most of the fight, rocking Allen with a spinning elbow in round 1 and out-jabbing a slowing Allen in round 4. Allen's wrestling kept him in it: a takedown and heavy ground-and-pound won round 2 (Duncan was also docked a point for an eye poke), and round 3 was a grappling grind. Early in round 5 Allen dragged Duncan down from a bodylock, took his back and choked him out at 2:46.",
   "turning_point": "Round 5: Allen's bodylock takedown to the back. Sherdog's scorers had Duncan narrowly ahead going into it, MMA Mania had Allen.",
   "sources": [
    {
     "outlet": "Sherdog",
     "url": "https://www.sherdog.com/news/news/UFC-Vegas-122-Allen-vs-Duncan-playbyplay-results-round-scoring-203155",
     "round_scores": "R1 10-9 Duncan · R2 10-8 Allen · R3 10-9 Duncan (10-9 Duncan, 10-9 Duncan, 10-9 Allen) · R4 10-9 Duncan (Sherdog's three scorers)"
    },
    {
     "outlet": "MMA Mania",
     "url": "https://www.mmamania.com/ufc-results/476968/ufc-vegas-122-live-results-highlights-play-by-play-allen-vs-duncan"
    }
   ],
   "written": "2026-10-12"
  },
  "lupita-godinez-ketlen-souza": {
   "summary": "Souza, who missed weight, out-struck Godinez for two rounds with jabs, uppercuts and leg kicks, stuffing her early takedown attempts and leaving her bloodied. Godinez finally landed a single-leg in round 3 and rode out the round with ground-and-pound from guard. All three judges gave it to Godinez 29-28; all three Sherdog scorers and MMA Mania had Souza 29-28.",
   "turning_point": "A disputed decision: the judges gave Godinez round 1 or 2, which every media scorer gave Souza.",
   "sources": [
    {
     "outlet": "Sherdog",
     "url": "https://www.sherdog.com/news/news/UFC-Vegas-122-Allen-vs-Duncan-playbyplay-results-round-scoring-203155",
