   "written": "2026-10-12"
  },
  "julius-walker-gerald-meerschaert": {
   "summary": "Walker, younger and far stronger, clinched, took Meerschaert down and battered him with elbows and punches from top for all of round 1 (Meerschaert's armbar attempt went nowhere). He took him down again in round 2 and finished with ground-and-pound at 3:35. Meerschaert left his gloves in the cage.",
   "sources": [
