  "francisco-prado-ismael-bonfim": {
   "summary": "Bonfim missed weight by 8.5 pounds. Prado out-boxed him early, landed an overhand left, then took him down and kept him there with knees and punches. When Bonfim got up he was taken down again, and a hard elbow from full guard started the ground-and-pound that ended it at 4:23 of round 1.",
