  "niko-price-leon-shahbazyan": {
   "summary": "Price, in what was billed as his retirement fight, rushed Shahbazyan, shrugged off a guillotine and stayed on top. Shahbazyan offered almost no defence as Price rained elbows and punches from half guard and on the feet over him, and the referee stopped it at 1:58 of round 1.",
