  "brendson-ribeiro-felipe-franco": {
   "summary": "After a minute of feeling out, Franco shot for a takedown and put his neck straight into a guillotine. Ribeiro (who missed weight) held it as Franco tried to slam free, rolled to mount and got the tap at 1:49 of round 1.",
