  "allen-frye-richard-harris": {
   "summary": "The unbeaten Harris started well, landing jabs, an overhand right and steady leg kicks, but with his hands low and his chin up. Midway through round 1 Frye landed a right hand that sent him backward, followed with a left hook and three more rights, and finished him on the floor at 2:59.",
   "turning_point": "Harris's low hands: Frye's first clean right turned it.",
